+- Known tradeoff (from the superseded record): the shell renders inside split panes as narrow as 380px on a 1440px
+  screen. A viewport query picks the two-column layout inside a narrow pane and can clip the sidebar (incident
+  2026-09-14). The maintainer accepted this when overriding.
